  "statuteText": "21-H:14-d Transitional Housing Unit Maintenance Fund Established. –\n\nThere is established in the office of the commissioner a fund to be known as the transitional housing unit maintenance fund. This fund shall be nonlapsing and continually appropriated to the commissioner for the purpose of the general care, maintenance, repair, and proper upkeep of transitional housing units. The commissioner shall collect funds as specified in RSA 651:25, V for deposit into the fund and may expend such funds as set forth in this section. The commissioner may also accept gifts, grants, and donations from any state or federal source for deposit into the fund."
